        {
          "text": "Ala mekwona makakũketeea, na makasũanĩa ũndũ waku, makyasya, Mũndũ ũũ nĩwe ũla watetemasya nthĩ, ũla wathingithangasya mosumbĩ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ũla watw’ĩkĩthisye nthĩ weũ, na kwananga ndũa syayo; ũla ũtaathasya ovwa make menũke? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
