              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndũkatane, we Vilisitia yonthe, nĩkwĩthĩwa ndata ĩla yakũkũnie nĩ ndũlĩku; nũndũ kĩmbuva kĩkauma kĩtinani kya nzoka, na ũsyao wakyo ũkeethĩwa nzoka ĩũlũkaa ĩilyĩ mwaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na makithathi ma ngya makaĩsaa, na ala athĩni makakomaa mate na mũisyo; na ngooaa kĩtina kyaku na yũa, na ũtialo waku ũkooawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaya, we mbingĩlo; ĩa, we ndũa; nũtwekete, we Vilisitia yonthe; nũndũ syũki nĩyũkĩte kuma ngalĩ ya ĩũlũ, na vati ũmwe wĩtiĩlwa ĩtina mĩkwĩlĩnĩ yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
